The sentence-streaming approach and Japanese immediate sentence boundaries
were developed while modifying Hermes Agent's tools/tts_streaming.py.
This standalone implementation adapts that approach with a lossless bounded
splitter, a standalone standard-library VOICEVOX client, explicit WAV/PCM
metadata, cancellation, tests, and examples by yukincom.

